So currently we lack a proper homepage. We do not have a homepage and whenever we load the website, it directly lands to the login page, so we need to fix that as we require a homepage and there should be a login slash register button.in the navigation, so people know what is MedTalk about from the homepage and they can log in or register according to their needs. Moreover, there are a few ambiguities in terms of the pages that are inside. We also lack request history page and So we have two different separately pages, my requests and new requests. I want you to combine both of them. As in the content that is in my request should come under new requests and the new page should be called requests. That's it. And both of the request-related pages should be combined into one. These are some of the changes that I really need to happen because right now I'm not just creating this as a university project, I'm creating this as a full-fledged website that should be That should have the ability to be used by real-life pharmasists</p><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-12 bg-gradient-to-t from-bg-300 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div></div><button class="pb-3 pt-1 text-xs text-text-500/80 hover:text-text-100 transition w-3/4 text-left rounded-lg">Show more</button></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><span class="text-text-500 text-xs flex items-center mr-2" data-state="closed">6:01 PM</span><div class="flex items-center"><div class="w-fit" data-state="closed"><button class="inline-flex
