-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">7. Non-Functional Requirements</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Security, usability, performance — how each is met in code</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">8. UI Wireframes</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Every page (HomePage, Login, Register, Dashboard, Requests, Repayments, Profile, all Admin pages) with layout description</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">9. Backend Architecture</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Full folder structure with explanation of every file</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">10. API Endpoints</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">All 14 endpoints with method, path, access level, description</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">11. Middleware</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">All 9 middleware (protect, adminOnly, pharmacyOnly, ok(), fail(), CORS, etc.) explained precisely</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">12. Auth Flow Diagram</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Registration (9 steps), Login (9 steps), Protected Request (8 steps) — all mapped to code</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">13. Request &amp; Repayment Flow</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Submit request (9 steps), Admin approve/reject (10 steps), Repayment tracking (6 steps)</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">14. Database Schema</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">All 4 collections (users, pharmacies, requests, repayments) with every field, type, constraints + sample documents</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">15. Security Measures</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">11 security measures mapped to exact code locations</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">16. Testing Table</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">24 test cases covering success, failure, unauthorized, forbidden, and edge cases</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">17. Deployment</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">MongoDB Atlas + Render + Vercel step-by-step guide with environment variables</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">18. Limitations</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">9 honest limitations of the current system</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">19. Future Work</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">10 planned improvements</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">20. GitHub &amp; Links</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Template table for your GitHub repo, deployed URLs, admin credentials</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
