          ease-[cubic-bezier(0.165,0.85,0.45,1)] h-8 w-8 rounded-md backdrop-blur-md _fill_10ocf_9 _ghost_10ocf_96" type="button" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" data-state="closed"><div class="relative"><div class="transition-all opacity-100 scale-100" style="width: 20px; height: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="transition-all opacity-100 scale-100" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><path d="M12.5 3A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 14 4.5V6h1.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 17 7.5v8a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-8A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 6 15.5V14H4.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 12.5v-8A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4.5 3zm1.5 9.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5H7v1.5a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h8a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-8a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5H14zM4.5 4a.5.5 0 0 0-.5.5v8a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h8a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-8a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5z"></path></svg></div><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="transition-all opacity-0 scale-50" style="width: 20px; height: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="transition-all opacity-0 scale-50" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><path d="M15.188 5.11a.5.5 0 0 1 .752.626l-.056.084-7.5 9a.5.5 0 0 1-.738.033l-3.5-3.5-.064-.078a.501.501 0 0 1 .693-.693l.078.064 3.113 3.113 7.15-8.58z"></path></svg></div></div></div></button></div></div><div class="text-text-500 font-small p-3.5 pb-0">bash</div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><pre class="code-block__code !my-0 !rounded-lg !text-sm !leading-relaxed p-3.5" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono);"><code class="language-bash" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono); white-space: pre;"><span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">git</span><span> init
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">git</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">add</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(251, 173, 96);">.</span><span>
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">git</span><span> commit -m </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">"Initial commit: MedStock full-stack pharmacy inventory system"</span><span>
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">git</span><span> branch -M main
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">git</span><span> remote </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">add</span><span> origin https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/medstock.git
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">git</span><span> push -u origin main</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Replace <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">YOUR_USERNAME</code> with your actual GitHub username.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>1.6 Verify</strong>
Go to <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/medstock</code> — you should see both folders there. Make sure <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.env</code> is NOT visible in the files list.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 2 — Deploy Database (MongoDB Atlas) — do this before backend</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>2.1</strong> Go to <strong>mongodb.com/atlas</strong> → Sign up free</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>2.2</strong> Create a project → Build a Database → Choose <strong>M0 Free Tier</strong> → Select a region (closest to Pakistan: Mumbai or Singapore)</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>2.3</strong> Database Access tab → Add New Database User</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Username: <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">medstockuser</code></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Password: something strong, save it</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Role: Read and write to any database</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>2.4</strong> Network Access tab → Add IP Address → Click <strong>Allow Access from Anywhere</strong> (0.0.0.0/0)</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>2.5</strong> Click <strong>Connect</strong> on your cluster → <strong>Connect your application</strong> → Copy the connection string. It looks like:</p>
<div role="group" aria-label="Code" tabindex="0" class="relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-100"><div class="sticky opacity-0 group-hover/copy:opacity-100 group-focus-within/copy:opacity-100 top-2 py-2 h-12 w-0 float-right"><div class="absolute right-0 h-8 px-2 items-center inline-flex z-10"><button class="inline-flex
  items-center
  justify-center
  relative
  isolate
