          ease-[cubic-bezier(0.165,0.85,0.45,1)] h-8 w-8 rounded-md backdrop-blur-md _fill_10ocf_9 _ghost_10ocf_96" type="button" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" data-state="closed"><div class="relative"><div class="transition-all opacity-100 scale-100" style="width: 20px; height: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="transition-all opacity-100 scale-100" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><path d="M12.5 3A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 14 4.5V6h1.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 17 7.5v8a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-8A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 6 15.5V14H4.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 12.5v-8A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4.5 3zm1.5 9.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5H7v1.5a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h8a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-8a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5H14zM4.5 4a.5.5 0 0 0-.5.5v8a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h8a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-8a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5z"></path></svg></div><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="transition-all opacity-0 scale-50" style="width: 20px; height: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="transition-all opacity-0 scale-50" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><path d="M15.188 5.11a.5.5 0 0 1 .752.626l-.056.084-7.5 9a.5.5 0 0 1-.738.033l-3.5-3.5-.064-.078a.501.501 0 0 1 .693-.693l.078.064 3.113 3.113 7.15-8.58z"></path></svg></div></div></div></button></div></div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><pre class="code-block__code !my-0 !rounded-lg !text-sm !leading-relaxed p-3.5" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono);"><code style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono); white-space: pre-wrap;"><span><span>https://medstock-api.onrender.com/api/health</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">You should see <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">{ "success": true, "message": "MedStock API running" }</code>. If you see that, your backend is live.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Copy your Render URL</strong> — you need it for the frontend next.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 4 — Deploy Frontend (Vercel)</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>4.1</strong> Go to <strong>vercel.com</strong> → Sign up with GitHub</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>4.2</strong> Click <strong>Add New Project</strong> → Import your <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">medstock</code> GitHub repo</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>4.3</strong> Configure it:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Root Directory:</strong> <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">medstock-frontend/frontend</code></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Framework Preset:</strong> Vite (Vercel usually detects this automatically)</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Build Command:</strong> <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">npm run build</code></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Output Directory:</strong> <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">dist</code></li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>4.4</strong> Before deploying, add Environment Variable:</p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto w-full px-2 mb-6"><table class="min-w-full border-collapse text-sm leading-[1.7] whitespace-normal"><thead class="text-left"><tr><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Key</th><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top"><code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">VITE_API_URL</code></td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top"><code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">https://medstock-api.onrender.com/api</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">(Use your actual Render URL from Step 3)</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>4.5</strong> Click <strong>Deploy</strong> — takes about 1 minute.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>4.6</strong> Visit your Vercel URL (something like <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">medstock.vercel.app</code>) — you should see your homepage.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 5 — Take Your Evidence Screenshots</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Once everything is live, take screenshots of:</p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">GitHub repo page showing all your files and commit history</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Vercel dashboard showing deployment successful</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Render dashboard showing service is live</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">MongoDB Atlas showing your collections (users, pharmacies, requests, repayments) — register a test user to populate them</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">The live homepage on your Vercel URL</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">The health check URL returning success</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Postman/Thunder Client — test each API against the <strong>deployed Render URL</strong> (not localhost)</li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">One Important Note About Render Free Tier</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Render's free tier <strong>spins down after 15 minutes of inactivity</strong>. The first request after it sleeps takes 30-60 seconds. This is fine for your submission — just open the health check URL a minute before your viva so it's awake. Alternatively, Railway.app has a similar free tier that may be faster to wake up.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><div class="w-fit" data-state="closed"><button class="inline-flex
