<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">The Right Way on Windows</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>First, stop and close that PowerShell window.</strong> Let's start fresh properly.</p>
