<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3" start="3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>File → Save As</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Navigate to your <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">medstock-project</code> folder</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">In the filename box type: <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.gitignore</code></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Change <strong>Save as type</strong> to <strong>All Files (*.*)</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click Save</li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
