/span><span>u origin main</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">It will ask for your GitHub <strong>username</strong> and <strong>password</strong>. For the password, GitHub no longer accepts your account password — you need a <strong>Personal Access Token</strong>:</p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">On GitHub → click your profile picture → <strong>Settings</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Scroll to bottom → <strong>Developer settings</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Personal access tokens</strong> → <strong>Tokens (classic)</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Generate new token (classic)</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Give it a name, set expiry to 90 days, tick <strong>repo</strong> checkbox</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Generate token</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Copy the token immediately</strong> (you can't see it again)</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Use this token as your password when PowerShell asks</li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">Step 6 — Verify it worked</h4>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Go to <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">https://github.com/YourUsername/medstock</code> in your browser. You should see both folders listed. Make sure <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.env</code> is <strong>not</strong> visible in the file list.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Once that's done, come back and we'll do the MongoDB Atlas + Render + Vercel deployment together. Do one step at a time and paste any errors here if something goes wrong.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><div class="w-fit" data-state="closed"><button class="inline-flex
